  "dataset": "World Values Survey country/wave results (aggregated PDF/XLSX reports)",
  "note": "Wave 7 (2017\u20132022) is the latest completed WVS-only wave available from the WVS Data Archive as of retrieval. WVS-8 fieldwork is planned for 2024\u20132026 and is not published as equivalent country-results PDFs yet. No figures were invented or transcribed by hand \u2014 files are WVS archive downloads (JP/NZ/SG + wave Results-by-Country) or user-provided copies that match archive titles/DOIDs (AU/BR/ID/MY). France never fielded a WVS Wave 6 or Wave 7 survey \u2014 confirmed by checking the WVS Data Archive's own per-wave country index (AJDocumentation.jsp?CndWAVE=1..9), which lists France only under Wave 1, Wave 2 (both EVS re-hosts, 1981\u20131984/1990\u20131994) and Wave 5 (2006). The latest France data on worldvaluessurvey.org is the officially co-published Joint EVS/WVS 2017\u20132022 dataset (WVSA + European Values Study), whose France component fielded 2018-03-02 to 2018-08-16 (CAPI, French, EVS round) \u2014 see the joint-evs-wvs-2017-2022 entries below, downloaded directly from https://www.worldvaluessurvey.org/WVSEVSjoint2017.jsp.",
